  "description": "Eight years ago, Do Seung-Ho, who killed his mother, ran away from his only friend Shin Jae-Hui, who knew his secret. Seung-Ho, who thought he could leave behind the past when he ran away from his hometown and suffered financial hardships and dream of a happy future with his lover Yeong-Jin, who he can envy, when Jae-Hui appears in front of him one day...\n\n *\"There is no one in this world who will understand you except me, Seung-Ho.\"* \n\nSeung-Ho's life begins to fall into chaos once again when Jae-Hui appears, claiming to have evidence of his mother's death. \n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
